# Banned product tokens — plain substring, case-sensitive.
# Scope: agents/** + skills/**.
# Seed per paired-scaffold-capability spec §C; append per-product on
# onboarding ("/studio:init" or after a de-contamination pass surfaces a new
# leak). One token per line. Lines beginning with # are comments.
#
# Note on "Log": the bare token matches dictionary words ("Logical", verb
# usage like "Log the entry"). This is intentional — when a real word fires
# the lint, rephrase the prose ("Logical" → "Structural"; "Log the session
# header" → "Record the session header"). The seam is enforced; ambiguity
# is the prose's problem, not the lint's.

Log
Log Canvas
LogApp
studio_os/
